# An acceptance that has stopped applying, and the only way to find that out is to ask.
#
# Somebody signed this exposure off, and the service now answers with a login form — so the
# thing the file excuses is not what the scan finds. The acceptance is reported as drift
# naming what was measured, rather than left sitting there looking correct: a stale acceptance
# is the single most dangerous line a sidecar can carry, because it silences a finding.
services:
  app:
    description: Staff tool, signed off as open when it had no login.
    unauthenticated:
      intentional: true
      reason: Internal tool with no login, trusted VLAN only.
